==English==
{{wp|Tuesday (disambiguation)|Tuesday}}
{{wp|Week-day names}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dʰegʷʰ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|Tewesday}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tīwesdæġ||Tuesday}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*Tīwas dag||Tuesday|lit=Tiw's Day}}. 

This was a [[interpretatio germanica|Germanic interpretation]] of {{cog|la|diēs Mārtis}}, itself a translation of {{cog|grc|Ἄρεως ἡμέρα}} ({{w|interpretatio romana}}). Cognate with {{cog|sco|Tysday||Tuesday}}, {{cog|stq|Täisdai||Tuesday}}, {{cog|fy|tiisdei||Tuesday}}, dialectal {{cog|de|Ziestag||Tuesday}}, {{cog|da|tirsdag||Tuesday}}, {{cog|sv|tisdag||Tuesday}}. More at {{m|en|Tyr}}, {{m|en|day}}.
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dyew-}}

